---

The SERVARI OS shell server is pure Python standard library and requires no
third-party packages to run.

The React user interface (under ui/) is built with third-party open-source
packages declared in ui/package.json; each is distributed under its own
license (predominantly MIT). Their full license texts are reproduced in the
respective package directories under ui/node_modules/ after `npm install`.

The optional desktop shell uses Electron and electron-builder, declared in the
root package.json under their own licenses.

The optional local-voice integration references faster-whisper and piper-tts,
which are downloaded by the operator at their own discretion under their own
licenses; they are not bundled with this repository.

